    <bpmn:process id="W_W4089" name="W4089. Digital Adoption Strategy &amp; In-App Guidance (Digital Adoption Platform)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Major system deployment (ERP, POS, ecommerce, WMS, CRM)
Frequency: Per deployment + maintained
Volume: Enterprise systems (ERP for ~6,932 users; POS for cashiers; CRM/app for staff)
Owner: OCM Lead / IT Adoption Lead (links to VS-27)
Participants: IT (VS-27), Enterprise Architecture (VS-113), L&amp;D (VS-19.4), process owners
Source: workflow W4089 — Digital Adoption Strategy &amp; In-App Guidance (Digital Adoption Platform)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4089_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4089_Lane1" name="OCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4089_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4089_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4089_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4089_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4089_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4089_Start3" name="Major system deployment (ERP, POS, ecommerce, WMS, CRM)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4089_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4089_Task4" name="OCM/IT define the digital-adoption strategy: a Digital Adoption Platform (DAP)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OCM/IT define the digital-adoption strategy: a Digital Adoption Platform (DAP) for in-app walkthroughs/contextual help, self-service enablement, and usage analytics across the ERP, POS, ecommerce, and WMS
Responsible (R): OCM / IT / EA
Accountable (A): CHRO / CIO
Duration: Per deployment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4089_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4089_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4089_Task5" name="OCM/IT build role/role-based in-app guidance, smart tips, and onboarding tours…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OCM/IT build role/role-based in-app guidance, smart tips, and onboarding tours, and integrate with training (W4090) and the service desk (VS-27.1)
Responsible (R): OCM / IT / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): OCM Lead
Duration: Per deployment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4089_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4089_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4089_Task6" name="OCM/IT measure adoption lift from DAP, optimize content, and sustain as systems…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OCM/IT measure adoption lift from DAP, optimize content, and sustain as systems evolve
Responsible (R): OCM / IT
Accountable (A): OCM Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4089_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4089_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4089_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4089_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4089_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-634 (ensure controlled execution — Digital Adoption, Training &amp; Sustainment Analytics (PA-134.3).) | - CTL-634: DAP content governance; data-privacy for usage analytics (links to VS-91)
Owner: OCM Lead / IT Adoption Lead (links to VS-27)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
