    <bpmn:process id="W_W4090" name="W4090. Role-Based Learning, Training &amp; Enablement for Change" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Change requiring new capability; go-live approach
Frequency: Per initiative + maintained
Volume: ~6,932 employees + contingent (links to VS-98); role-based curricula
Owner: OCM Lead / L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4)
Participants: L&amp;D (VS-19.4/VS-124), HR (VS-103), champions (W4084), process owners
Source: workflow W4090 — Role-Based Learning, Training &amp; Enablement for Change</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4090_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4090_Lane1" name="OCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4090_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4090_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4090_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4090_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4090_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4090_Start3" name="Change requiring new capability; go-live approach">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4090_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4090_Task4" name="OCM/L&amp;D build role-based learning (what each role must know/do differently)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OCM/L&amp;D build role-based learning (what each role must know/do differently), mapped to impacts (W4076) and the job architecture (VS-102.1), with multiple modalities (e-learning, classroom, on-the-job, super-user)
Responsible (R): OCM / L&amp;D / Process Owners
Accountable (A): OCM Lead / CHRO
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4090_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4090_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4090_Task5" name="OCM/L&amp;D deliver training ahead of go-live, certify readiness (training-complete…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OCM/L&amp;D deliver training ahead of go-live, certify readiness (training-complete as a go-live gate per W4087), and provide just-in-time support via DAP (W4089)
Responsible (R): OCM / L&amp;D / Champions
Accountable (A): OCM Lead
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4090_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4090_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4090_Task6" name="OCM/L&amp;D measure training effectiveness (knowledge, application), refresh for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OCM/L&amp;D measure training effectiveness (knowledge, application), refresh for new hires/late adopters, and integrate into onboarding (links to VS-103/VS-121)
Responsible (R): OCM / L&amp;D / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4090_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4090_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4090_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4090_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4090_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-634 (ensure controlled execution — Digital Adoption, Training &amp; Sustainment Analytics (PA-134.3).) | - CTL-634: training-complete go-live gate for critical roles
Owner: OCM Lead / L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
