    <bpmn:process id="W_W4091" name="W4091. User Adoption Measurement, System Usage &amp; Adoption Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Go-live; continuous
Frequency: Continuous (daily/weekly)
Volume: Enterprise systems (~6,932 users across ERP/POS/WMS/CRM/app)
Owner: OCM Data Lead / BI (links to VS-28)
Participants: BI (VS-28), IT (VS-27), HR analytics (VS-103.3), process owners
Source: workflow W4091 — User Adoption Measurement, System Usage &amp; Adoption Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4091_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4091_Lane1" name="OCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4091_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4091_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4091_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4091_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4091_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4091_Start3" name="Go-live; continuous">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4091_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4091_Task4" name="OCM/BI define adoption metrics (active users, feature usage, process…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OCM/BI define adoption metrics (active users, feature usage, process compliance, time-on-system, error/exception rates, support-ticket volume) and baselines, by role/site
Responsible (R): OCM / BI
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per system</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4091_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4091_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4091_Task5" name="OCM/BI build the adoption dashboard, detect laggards/exceptions, and correlate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OCM/BI build the adoption dashboard, detect laggards/exceptions, and correlate adoption to benefit (W4095) and to resistance signals (W4085)
Responsible (R): OCM / BI
Accountable (A): OCM Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4091_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4091_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4091_Task6" name="OCM report adoption to sponsors/leadership, trigger interventions where…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OCM report adoption to sponsors/leadership, trigger interventions where adoption lags, and track to sustainment targets
Responsible (R): OCM
Accountable (A): Sponsor / COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4091_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4091_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4091_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4091_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
