    <bpmn:process id="W_W4092" name="W4092. Behavioral Change &amp; Process Compliance Sustainment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Post-go-live; compliance drift detected
Frequency: Continuous post-go-live
Volume: Per changed process across 200 stores/4 DCs/HQ
Owner: Process Owner / OCM Lead
Participants: Process owners, OpEx (VS-133), Quality (VS-31), managers, Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4092 — Behavioral Change &amp; Process Compliance Sustainment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4092_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4092_Lane1" name="OCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4092_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4092_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4092_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4092_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4092_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4092_Start3" name="Post-go-live; compliance drift detected">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4092_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4092_Task4" name="OCM/process owner sustain the change: monitor process compliance (via process…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OCM/process owner sustain the change: monitor process compliance (via process mining VS-133 W4058 and adoption W4091), and detect reversion to old ways
Responsible (R): OCM / Process Owner / OpEx
Accountable (A): Process Owner
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4092_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4092_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4092_Task5" name="OCM/OpEx intervene on non-compliance (coaching, re-training, barrier removal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OCM/OpEx intervene on non-compliance (coaching, re-training, barrier removal, control reinforcement W4063), and address systemic causes with OpEx (VS-133)
Responsible (R): OCM / OpEx / Managers
Accountable (A): Process Owner
Duration: Per signal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4092_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4092_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4092_Task6" name="OCM/process owner embed the change into standard work/SOPs (VS-30.3)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OCM/process owner embed the change into standard work/SOPs (VS-30.3), performance expectations, and onboarding, then transition fully to BAU
Responsible (R): OCM / Process Owner / HR
Accountable (A): Process Owner
Duration: Post-go-live</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4092_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4092_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
